Oil and gas conservation commission-regulation
SF0015
of pits.
Sponsored By: Joint Minerals, Business & Economic Development
Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to oil and gas; amending the authority of the Wyoming oil and
gas conservation commission to regulate noncommercial reserve pits, produced
water retention pits and emergency overflow pits as specified; and providing
for an effective date.
